he beach and ocean in front","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","isBasedOn":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"North Ocean Boulevard, City of Myrtle Beach (tax district 880), Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"A tall tan condo tower and several low-rise condo buildings with pools on the beach at Garden City, with beach houses and a wide salt marsh behind them","caption":"Garden City Beach, outside city limits: a condo tower and low-rise condo buildings on North Waccamaw Drive, with the marsh behind, seen from a plane in 2011.","description":"A tall tan condo tower and several low-rise condo buildings with pools on the beach at Garden City, with beach houses and a wide salt marsh behind them","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","isBasedOn":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"North Waccamaw Drive, Garden City Beach, unincorporated Horry County (tax district 610), Garden City Beach, South Carolina"}}]}</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Ready to look at condos?</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Tell us your price range and how you plan to rent. If you buy with us, an agent reads each building's rental rules, confirms the loan with the lender and gets you an insurance quote before you make an offer.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us help buy your next unit</a></div></section></main>
